sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Nexora UI
  participant API as seoGeo API
  participant Google as Google OAuth
  participant Store as seo-geo-google.json

  User->>UI: Connect Google
  UI->>API: GET /oauth/start
  API->>Google: Redirect consent
  Google->>User: Approve scopes
  Google->>API: GET /oauth/callback
  API->>Store: Save tokens
  API->>UI: Redirect success
  User->>UI: Re-audit
  UI->>API: POST /audit
  API->>Google: Read GSC + GBP
  Google-->>API: Indexing · location data
  API-->>UI: Recommendations with evidence
